# Workflow execution artifacts — deliberately a DENY-list, never a catch-all.
#
# A `*` + negations whitelist hides every file the agent creates from
# `git status` and `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard`. Verified
# consequences: an untracked file adding `@ts-ignore` becomes invisible to the
# anti-tampering scan and to check-blast-radius.sh, and `git add .specify` fails
# with "paths are ignored", so the tooling baseline commit never happens and the
# gates grade an empty diff. Keep this list explicit.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/

# Framework build output
.next/
.nuxt/
.astro/
.svelte-kit/
.output/

# Visual-audit artifacts. The golden screenshots under
# tests/design/__snapshots__/ are DERIVED from designs/<screen>.html on every
# run (render-design-goldens.mjs): the HTML is the committed master, the PNGs
# are build output. Only the HTML stays tracked.
tests/design/__snapshots__/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.vite/

# Workflow run state and machine telemetry (they store agent transcripts)
.specify/workflows/runs/
.specify/telemetry.jsonl

*.local
.DS_Store
